# A transformer with no core: two coils facing each other across a gap.
kind transformer
convention A transformer: two coils facing each other across a gap, no core drawn.
pin 1 -100 -70
pin 2 -100 70
pin 3 100 -70
pin 4 100 70
line -100 -70 -30 -70 -30 -60
line -100 70 -30 70 -30 60
line 100 -70 30 -70 30 -60
line 100 70 30 70 30 60
arc -30 -45.0 15.0 -90 180
arc -30 -15.0 15.0 -90 180
arc -30 15.0 15.0 -90 180
arc -30 45.0 15.0 -90 180
arc 30 -45.0 15.0 -90 -180
arc 30 -15.0 15.0 -90 -180
arc 30 15.0 15.0 -90 -180
arc 30 45.0 15.0 -90 -180
